THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL — NOT COVERED BY THE LICENCE ABOVE

ShaperWaveDynamics (SWD) is commercial software. No part of it is redistributed
in this repository. The CSVs under SWD/data/ are measurements taken from a
licensed installation, not extracts of the application.

Supplementary data under SWD/data/paper-supplementary/ accompanies:

    Charles et al. (2026), Results in Engineering 29:108868
    DOI 10.1016/j.rineng.2025.108868

and is redistributed under CC BY 4.0 with attribution recorded in that
directory's SOURCE.md.

Surfboard designs in the SWD library are attributable to named third-party
shapers. Shaper names are never exported, and the per-element contact geometry
(a reproducible description of a hull's wetted shape) is gitignored rather than
committed.
